{"id":"635749","name":"鸡蛋红薯粉皮","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/635749/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红薯粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"4个"},{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"一个"},{"name":"大蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好红薯粉。","img":"images/635749/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"磕入4个鸡蛋。","img":"images/635749/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加适量的盐和水，搅拌均匀，成较稀的面糊。","img":"images/635749/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅烧热，加一点点油。","img":"images/635749/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入鸡蛋红薯粉面糊，摊开。","img":"images/635749/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煎至一面定型。","img":"images/635749/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻面。","img":"images/635749/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"一张一张摊完。","img":"images/635749/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放在一起，卷起来，切成小条。","img":"images/635749/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"辣椒和大蒜头都切好。","img":"images/635749/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"起锅烧热，加油。","img":"images/635749/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"下入辣椒和大蒜头，翻炒出香味。","img":"images/635749/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"下入粉条。","img":"images/635749/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加适量的水，大火烧开。","img":"images/635749/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加盐、生抽稍煮一会儿，最后加入鸡精和葱花。","img":"images/635749/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"起锅装盘。","img":"images/635749/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/635749/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}